SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — 20–25 min easy walk/jog only if body ba
 ttery on waking is ≥3
DESCRIPTION:20–25 min easy walk/jog only if body battery on waking is ≥
 35\; if body battery is below 35\, replace with a 20-min gentle walk and p
 ostpone the jog to 12 August — do not combine with the swim on the same 
 day.\n\nReason: Body battery has been at 0–11 for several consecutive da
 ys (Aug 3–6\, Aug 8) and the athlete is only just reaching the end of th
 e doctor-ordered rest window\; splitting or shortening the first session r
 educes relapse risk.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-08
