SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Move to 12 August (Wednesday\, nominally
  a rest day) and keep
DESCRIPTION:Move to 12 August (Wednesday\, nominally a rest day) and keep a
 t 1\,000m max — only if the Tuesday run/walk felt fully comfortable and 
 body battery has recovered above 40\; skip entirely if still symptomatic.\
 n\nReason: Stacking a swim on top of the first run-back session on the sam
 e day is excessive given critically depleted body battery readings through
  8 August\; separating them by 24 hours reduces total daily stress on an i
 mmune system still recovering from illness.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-08
