  easy\, cadence 85–90 
DESCRIPTION:Reduce to 30 min at 100–130W (perceived easy\, cadence 85–9
 0 rpm) and skip if morning body battery is below 40 — this is still a sy
 stems-check only\, not a fitness session.\n\nReason: The athlete will only
  be 2 days into return-to-training and wellness data shows a persistent pa
 ttern of very low body battery\; keeping the ride shorter and below the or
 iginal adjusted target limits cumulative stress in the first week back.\n\
