SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] swimming — Extend to 2\,200–2\,400m and include a
  400m continuous time-tr
DESCRIPTION:Extend to 2\,200–2\,400m and include a 400m continuous time-t
 rial effort at target 2:30/100m pace in the middle of the session (e.g. 40
 0m warm-up\, 4×400m with 30s rest\, 200m cool-down) — this is the first
  Half Oceanman-specific swim stimulus.\n\nReason: With the Half Oceanman 5
 \,000m swim 56 days away and the target pace at 2:30/100m\, week 9 (if rec
 overy gates are passed) is the right moment to introduce the first race-pa
 ce swim block and begin progressive distance build.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08
 -08
