SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — If travelling abroad with no bike access\
 , replace entirely w
DESCRIPTION:If travelling abroad with no bike access\, replace entirely wit
 h a 75–90 min open-water or pool swim (2\,200–2\,500m at 2:25–2:30/1
 00m race pace) — this directly builds the Half Oceanman swim leg and req
 uires no equipment\; do not attempt to find a rental bike unless logistics
  are already confirmed.\n\nReason: Athlete is confirmed abroad the week of
  24 August\; bike access is uncertain\, and with the Half Oceanman 5\,000m
  swim being the nearest race target\, a swim replacement session delivers 
 more specific race value than a logistically uncertain ride.\n\nAI coachin
 g 2026-08-08
